        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 343.71,
          "end": 346.95,
          "en": "And here we can check if the platform is iOS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 346.95,
          "end": 349.68,
          "en": "And for that, an import must be added at the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 349.68,
          "end": 351.99,
          "en": "where you import dart:io",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 351.99,
          "end": 353.79,
          "en": "because that's the Dart package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 353.79,
          "end": 355.983,
          "en": "that provides this platform class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 357.06,
          "end": 358.40999999999997,
          "en": "And with that import added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 358.40999999999997,
          "end": 361.65,
          "en": "we can use this platform class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 361.65,
          "end": 365.4,
          "en": "and then check if we are on the iOS platform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
